+/**
+ * 3. <dg-coffee-card> — Reusable, Accessible Coffee Product Card Component
+ *
+ * Encapsulates:
+ * - Product photo, roast badge, calorie & caffeine metadata
+ * - Interactive size selector (Small 12oz, Medium 16oz, Large 20oz) with dynamic price calculation
+ * - Expandable accessible "Tasting Notes & Origin" disclosure panel (aria-expanded, aria-controls)
+ * - Favorite/Bookmark toggle button with aria-pressed state
+ * - "Add to Order" action button that dispatches `dg-add-to-cart` custom event
+ * - Preserves "View Details" link for navigation
